---
title: "Il tuo diploma"
kind: cert
when: "Oggi: il viaggio è completo!"
---
<name-cert>
  <div class="cert-wrap">
    <div class="cert-form">
      <div class="lumi-talk">
        <svg class="lumi" viewBox="-4 -4 108 108" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#lumi"/></svg>
        <div class="bubble" data-speak>
          <p>Ce l'abbiamo fatta! Abbiamo viaggiato per <strong>13,8 miliardi di anni</strong>, dal Big Bang fino alla nostra Terra.</p>
          <p>Grazie per essere venuto con me! Scrivi il tuo nome e ritira il tuo diploma. Ricorda: anche tu sei fatto di polvere di stelle! ✨</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <label class="name-field">
        <span>Come ti chiami?</span>
        <input type="text" maxlength="30" placeholder="Scrivi qui il tuo nome" autocomplete="given-name">
      </label>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <button class="btn big pink" type="button" data-party>🎉 Festeggia!</button>
        <button class="btn big sky" type="button" data-print>🖨️ Stampa il diploma</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cert">
      <svg class="cert-medal" viewBox="0 0 100 130" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#medal"/></svg>
      <p class="cert-kicker">Diploma di</p>
      <h2>Esploratore del Cosmo</h2>
      <p>Si certifica che</p>
      <p class="cert-name" data-name></p>
      <p>ha viaggiato con Lumi dal <strong>Big Bang</strong> alla <strong>nascita della Terra</strong>, scoprendo come sono nati le stelle, il Sole e il nostro pianeta.</p>
      <div class="cert-stats">
        <span>⭐ <b data-stars>0</b> stelle</span>
        <span>🏅 <b data-medals>0</b> medaglie su 4</span>
      </div>
      <p class="cert-date" data-date></p>
      <svg class="cert-lumi" viewBox="-4 -4 108 108" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#lumi"/></svg>
    </div>
  </div>
  <style>
    @scope {
      .cert-wrap {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        align-items: center;
        @container slide (width > 50rem) { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; }
      }
      .cert-form { display: grid; gap: 1.2rem; }
      .name-field {
        display: grid;
        gap: .4rem;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        & input {
          padding: .7rem 1rem;
          border: var(--border);
          border-radius: 1rem;
          background: #fff;
          font-size: 1.3rem;
          font-weight: 800;
          box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }
      }
      .cert {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        justify-items: center;
        gap: .5rem;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        border: 6px double var(--ink);
        outline: 4px solid var(--sun);
        outline-offset: -16px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 20% 15%, color-mix(in oklch, var(--sun) 30%, transparent), transparent 40%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 85% 85%, color-mix(in oklch, var(--pink) 25%, transparent), transparent 45%),
          #fff;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        animation: pop-in .8s var(--ease-bounce) both;
      }
      .cert-medal { width: 5rem; animation: medal-in 1.2s var(--ease-bounce) both .3s; }
      .cert-kicker { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .cert h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 1.2rem + 2vw, 2.6rem); color: var(--purple); }
      .cert-name {
        min-width: 70%;
        padding-bottom: .2rem;
        border-bottom: 3px dashed var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 1.2rem + 2.5vw, 2.8rem);
        line-height: 1.1;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .cert-stats { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.2rem; }
      .cert-date { font-size: .9rem; opacity: .7; }
      .cert-lumi { position: absolute; width: 4rem; right: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; animation: lumi-bob 2.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
    }
    @media print {
      body > :not(main), .journey, .pager, .slide-head, .cert-form { display: none !important; }
      body, .slide { background: #fff !important; box-shadow: none !important; border: none !important; }
      .slide::before { display: none; }
      .cert { box-shadow: none; }
    }
  </style>
</name-cert>
